{"ID":"20240205153809-xuuiuz3","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153809-xuuiuz3","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153809-xuuiuz3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206091840-cebyyyq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240613102228-3u7wnzu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240629172807-bzf323h\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:92,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:92\u0026#125;","title":"294商陆","type":"doc","updated":"20240823155713"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240823153003-ciyb1yx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"fold":"1","id":"20240823153003-ciyb1yx","updated":"20240823155713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"错录"}]},{"ID":"20240823153006-prjvzkt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"heading-fold":"1","id":"20240823153006-prjvzkt","updated":"20240823153115"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"其他商陆（多为外来入侵物种，有毒）"}]},{"ID":"20240823153139-209427u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"heading-fold":"1","id":"20240823153139-209427u","updated":"20240823153139"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产湖北、安徽、河南等地。\n【性状】\t干燥根横切或纵切成不规则的块片，大小不等。横切片弯曲不平，边缘皱缩，直径约2.56cm，厚约49mm，外皮灰黄色或灰棕色；切面类白色或黄白色，粗糙，具多数同心环状突起。纵切片卷曲，长约4.510cm，宽约1.53cm，表面凸凹不平，木质部成多数突起的纵条纹，质坚，不易折断。气微；味稍甜，后微苦，久嚼之麻舌。以片大色白、有粉性、两面环纹显明者为佳。\n【性味】\t苦，寒，有毒。\n【功效】\t通二便，泻水，散结。治水肿，胀满，脚气，喉痹，痈肿，恶疮。\n【注解】\t“罗盘纹”：指药材横切面有数轮同心排列环纹的异形构造，形似罗盘，也称为“同心环”。"}]},{"ID":"20240823153139-if5wmwf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"heading-fold":"1","id":"20240823153139-if5wmwf","updated":"20240823153139"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-202402